#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 58
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"windows which are on the same Xinerama screen as the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 66
#: rc.cpp:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort windows by desk&top"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 69
#: rc.cpp:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt+T"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 77
#: rc.cpp:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows in order of the "
"desktop they appear on.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 102
#: rc.cpp:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 105
#: rc.cpp:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt+S"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 113
#: rc.cpp:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> the "
"windows on the current desktop. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 129
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Group similar tasks:"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 152
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The taskbar can group similar windows into single buttons. When one of these "
"window group buttons are clicked on a menu appears showing all the windows "
"in that group. This can be especially useful with the <em>Show all "
"windows</em> option.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the taskbar to <strong>Never</strong> group windows, to "
"<strong>Always</strong> group windows or to group windows only <strong>When "
"the Taskbar is Full</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"By default the taskbar groups windows when it is full."
msgstr ""

